(text "U503 takes all eight data bits from 1.8 V to 3.3 V. U504 translates the clocks and controls." (at 16 132.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid de68e9be-0a85-574d-ad36-d97a17f3d5ea))
(text "TI AXC8 function table: DIR1=0, DIR2=0 gives both banks B to A. Both high gives A1:4 to B and B5:8 to A." (at 16 137.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 574b6877-43d2-52b5-9dd9-5ea4b6d2d691))
(text "R508 damps XCLK at U504. R509 damps the translated PCLK at U504. Scope clocks at both receiving ends." (at 16 142.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 1a332ece-6d9a-5f36-bfff-922bd76254f7))
(text "Use the sensor color-bar pattern to set the sampling edge in firmware and confirm lane order at the selected PCLK." (at 16 147.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 7c24209a-f0d9-5d76-aa75-e62e799a696a))
